@startuml
title 53. Report Paging — Preview → Paginated Detail

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam maxMessageSize 220

actor "User" as User
participant "Report Screen\n(EarningsReportScreen)" as RS
participant "Report Provider\n(EarningsReportProvider)" as Prov
participant "Report Service\n(EarningsReportService)" as Svc
participant "GoRouter" as Router
participant "Detail Screen\n(EarningsChargesScreen)\n+ DataLoadingMixin" as DS
participant "Report Handler\n(EarningsReportHandler)" as EH
participant "parsePaging /\npageSlice\n(report_paging.go)" as Page
participant "TransactionRepo" as TR
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== 1. Report page: small preview (limit = 8) ==

User -> RS: Open Earnings report
activate RS
RS -> Prov: setSelectedApp(appId)\n→ loadReport(appId)
activate Prov
note right of Prov: limit = kEarningsChargesPreview (8)\ncancel any superseded load
Prov -> Svc: fetchReport(appId, from, to,\n  limit=8)
Svc -> EH: GET /api/v1/apps/{appId}/reports/earnings\n?from&to&limit=8
activate EH

EH -> TR: FindByAppID(appId, from, to)
TR -> DB: SELECT transactions\nWHERE app_id AND date range
DB --> TR: transactions[]
TR --> EH: transactions[]

EH -> EH: SummarizeEarnings(txs)\n→ net / pending / available / paid (FULL set)
EH -> EH: buildEarningsCharges(txs)\n→ allCharges (sorted desc)
note right of EH: ChargesTotal = len(allCharges)\n(full count, before paging)

EH -> Page: parsePaging(r) → limit=8, offset=0
EH -> Page: pageSlice(allCharges, 0, 8)
Page --> EH: top-8 preview rows

EH --> Svc: JSON { currency, KPIs,\n  charges: [8 preview],\n  chargesTotal: N }
deactivate EH
Svc --> Prov: EarningsReport (preview)
Prov --> RS: notifyListeners()
deactivate Prov

RS -> User: KPIs + 8-row preview table\n"View all N charges →"\n(shown when chargesTotal > rows)
deactivate RS

== 2. Drill-down → paginated detail screen ==

User -> RS: Tap "View all N charges →"
RS -> Router: context.go('/reports/earnings/charges')
Router -> DS: build EarningsChargesScreen
activate DS
note right of DS: DataLoadingMixin fires loadData(appId)\nonce an app is available
DS -> Prov: setSelectedApp(appId) if changed
DS -> DS: _loadPage() (offset = 0)

== 3. Detail page: full window (limit = 50, offset = N) ==

DS -> Prov: fetchChargesPage(limit=50, offset=N)
activate Prov
Prov -> Svc: fetchReport(appId, from, to,\n  limit=50, offset=N)
Svc -> EH: GET /api/v1/apps/{appId}/reports/earnings\n?from&to&limit=50&offset=N
activate EH

EH -> TR: FindByAppID(appId, from, to)
TR -> DB: SELECT transactions
DB --> TR: transactions[]
TR --> EH: transactions[]

note right of EH: KPIs + chargesTotal still computed\nover the FULL set (paging-independent)
EH -> Page: parsePaging(r) → limit=50, offset=N\n(clamped to maxReportPageLimit=200)
EH -> Page: pageSlice(allCharges, N, 50)
Page --> EH: [offset, offset+50) window

EH --> Svc: JSON { KPIs, charges: [window],\n  chargesTotal: N }
deactivate EH
Svc --> Prov: EarningsReport (page)
Prov --> DS: EarningsReport
deactivate Prov

DS -> User: LgPaginatedTable\n(sticky header + scrolling rows +\n fixed footer "Showing X–Y of Z")

== 4. Prev / Next re-fetch ==

User -> DS: Tap Next → (offset += 50)
DS -> DS: _goTo(offset + 50) → _loadPage()
note right of DS: canPrev = offset > 0\ncanNext = to < total\n(both gated on !loading)
DS -> Prov: fetchChargesPage(limit=50, offset=N+50)
Prov -> Svc: fetchReport(... limit=50, offset=N+50)
Svc -> EH: GET ...&limit=50&offset=N+50
EH --> Svc: next window + chargesTotal
Svc --> Prov: EarningsReport
Prov --> DS: EarningsReport
DS -> User: table re-renders with new window
deactivate DS

note over RS, Page
  CSV export (format=csv) always writes the FULL table —
  paging (?limit/?offset) applies to the JSON charge rows only.
end note

@enduml
